# Normalise line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF,
# regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf. Without this, a Windows checkout
# produces CRLF working-tree files and the repo's source-inspection tests
# (which slice App.jsx on "\n...\n" markers) fail at load. The committed blobs
# are already LF, so this adds no diff — it just makes checkouts deterministic.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Common binary asset types — never touch these if any are added later.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.zip  binary
